\title{ヨよ木 (Yoyogi)}
\author{sezryo}
\meta{orcid}{0009-0008-0934-6821}
\p{I am Yve Meng. This is my personal website, realised as a [forester space](https://www.forester-notes.org/index/index.xml).}
\p{I am a \em{Quantitative Researcher} in [Mediobanca](https://www.mediobanca.com/en/index.html) in London. I am also a \em{Research Assistant} in [Thalesians](https://thalesians.com/). I hold degrees from Cambridge and Imperial.}
\p{I study foundations of stochastic analysis using category theory, game theory and differential geometry as a guide. My other interests include linguistics, programming languages, molecular anthropology and electoral system researches. Outside professional realms, I am also interested in mathematical music theory, rhythm game designs, composing, arranging and DJ-ing.}
\p{You may find more information about me in my [bio](sezryo), or directly [contact me](0006) for further discussions.}
\p{You may navigate this whole [forester](https://www.forester-notes.org/index/index.xml) via \code{ctrl+K}.}

